{
  "file" : "npc/cities/alberta.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "text" : "[Fabian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "text" : "Man... When you travel all around the world, you'll hear of some crazy things."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "text" : "[Fabian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "text" : "Once, I heard that there are Cards which contain the power of monsters. If someone happens to get their hands on a card, they'll be able to use that monster's power."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "text" : "[Fabian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "text" : "I'm guessing it's some sort of fad or scam, where they make you collect all the cards or whatever. I mean, how can a card really hold the power of a monster?!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "text" : "[Fabian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Fabian",
      "text" : "Seriously..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "text" : "[Steiner]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "text" : "Oh...!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "text" : "Welcome to Alberta,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "text" : "young adventurer!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "text" : "[Steiner]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "text" : "Pardon me if I seem distracted. I'm milling about, trying to make a plan. You see, I hear that there is a store in Geffen that sells armor that is resistant to magic."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "text" : "[Steiner]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Steiner",
      "text" : "If I buy a lot of them in bulk, and then resell them here for a higher price..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "text" : "[Chad]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "text" : "People say the legendary weapon Gungnir never misses its target. I wonder if it's possibly true..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "text" : "[Chad]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "text" : "People also say that babies are assembled by the storks before delivery, girls dig guys who act like jerks, and that Santa Claus exists! But only in Lutie."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "text" : "[Chad]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "text" : "I wonder..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "text" : "If any of that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "text" : "is possibly"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Chad",
      "text" : "true..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "[Deagle]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "^666666*Hiccup*^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "Wh-what are you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "staring at? Get lost!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "Say nothing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "Leave him alone."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "[Deagle]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "Hahahaha ^666666*hiccup*^000000... You've got some nerve. I may look worthless now, but I used to be a sailor on the 'Going Mary.'"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "Never heard of it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "Really? No kidding!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "[Deagle]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "Never heard of it?! Everybody knows th'notorious pirate ship 'Going Mary!' ^666666*Hiccup~*^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "[Deagle]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "Ah~ The ol'days. If only... If only we hadn't run into that STORM...^666666*hiccup*^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "[Deagle]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "AH~ Captain. I miss our cap'n more than anything... No foe survived before cap'n's sword."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "[Deagle]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "That's right! NOBODY meshes with the crew of the 'Going Mary!' And nobody can beat out cap'n in a sword fight!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "[Deagle]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "CAPTAIN~!!! ^666666*HICCUP~*^000000 He would swing his sword like this, then... THEN!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "[Deagle]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "The bastard the captain was fighting, and anyone of his friends near him, were surrounded in flame!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "[Deagle]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "Man, that sword must have had some sort of mysterious power, or the captain was just that good...!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "[Deagle]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "Phew~~ ^666666*Sob* *Sob...*^000000 God, I miss everyone! Now I'm depressed! Please, go away now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "[Deagle]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "That's right!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Drunken Old Man",
      "text" : "Go AWAY~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "[Shakir]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "We Merchants have our own negotiating skill when we sell goods. This skill can get us more money than when other people sell goods."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "[Shakir]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "It's more than just yelling 'You'll have to give more money please!' You need to have charisma, and master rhetoric!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "[Shakir]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "We can get up to 24 % more zeny with this incredible skill. But remember to train hard to acquire it!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "We Merchants can"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "open roadside stands"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "to do business."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "[Shakir]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "With the Discount skill, we can buy goods really cheap from the stores in towns and load them into the cart we rent."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "[Shakir]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "Then afterwards, we can travel anywhere, and sells our goods to make a profit!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "[Shakir]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Shakir",
      "text" : "This way, business is more convenient and safe. Don't fall asleep, although it's too easy to do that."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "[Sonya]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "Hey, you know, this one time I was walking through the forest and I saw this little green stem moving around."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "[Sonya]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "I went to see what it was and when I went to touch it. The stem actually slapped my hand!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "[Sonya]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "It startled me, so I jumped back a bit and then I realized it wasn't a stem, but a very small animal."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "[Sonya]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "I was lucky I didn't upset it. Even the smallest animal can be dangerous if angered."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "You know those lazy looking bears that live in the forest on the way to Payon?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "[Sonya]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "Just for fun, I threw a rock at it and all of sudden it rushed at me! I was sooooo scared, I started to run away, then BAM!!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "[Sonya]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "It ran into a low tree branch and knocked itself out! I swear, I'll never provoke an animal for fun again!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "I once saw a pack of wolves take on one of those huge, lazy bears!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "[Sonya]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "Wolves are much more cooperative than they may seem. If one of them is attacked, then any nearby wolves will run to help."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "[Sonya]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Sonya",
      "text" : "I'd think twice if you ever want to fight one when others of its kind are around. Be careful: don't get ganged up on!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "[Grandmother Alma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "Some time ago,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "a derelict ship"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "drifted into"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "Alberta harbour."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "[Grandmother Alma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "Hoping to save any survivors, some of the townspeople ventured into the ship. However, they all ran out terrified, saying that corpses were walking around inside the ship."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "[Grandmother Alma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "The ship was also packed with dangerous marine organisms, and they couldn't get inside, even if they wanted to."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "[Grandmother Alma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "We couldn't do anything about that ominous looking ship, and just left it as it was. Nowadays, exploration teams try to enter that ship and wipe out its monsters."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "[Grandmother Alma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Grandmother Alma",
      "text" : "So it might be a good experience for a young person like yourself to be a recruit. But, it's still not worth risking your life if you're not strong enough."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "[Fisk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "Ahoy mate,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "where'd ya"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "wanna go?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "Sunken Ship -> 250 zeny."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "Izlude Marina -> 500 zeny."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "Never mind."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "[Fisk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "Hey now, don't try to cheat me! I said 250 zeny!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 216,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "[Fisk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 217,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "Ain't no way yer getting there without the 500 zeny first!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "[Fisk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "Alright..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "Landlubber."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "[Fisk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 236,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "So you wanna head back to the mainland in Alberta, eh?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "Yes please."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Fisk",
      "text" : "I changed my mind."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 244,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "[Paul]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "Good day~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 246,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "Would you like"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "to join the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "exploration team"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "of the Sunken Ship?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 251,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "[Paul]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 252,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "Oh! Before you join, I must warn you. If you're not that strong, you may not want to go."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "[Paul]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 255,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "So, want"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 256,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "to sign up?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 257,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "The admission"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 258,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "fee is only"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 259,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "200 Zeny."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "Sign me up!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "Uh, no thanks."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 264,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "[Paul]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 265,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "It seems you don't have the money, my friend. But please come back when you're able to pay."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 272,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "[Paul]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "Alright, well..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Paul",
      "text" : "I'll be around"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 275,
